MODULE: ReceiverOmitsBatchReduction
TARGET: ReceiverRegimes
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: bypass the shared consumer action and preserve full load under pressure
PERTURBS: ReceiverShrinkBatch

--- FIND
    /\ phase = "feedback" /\ BP!ReceiverShrinkBatch
--- REPLACE
    /\ phase = "feedback" /\ controlPhase = 10 /\ controlPhase' = 11
    /\ control' = [receiver |-> FullBatch]
--- END
